                                                <p>This to inform you that your submitted pricelist titled <strong><t t-out='object.name'/></strong> has been successfully reviewed and approved by <strong><t t-out="ctx.get('action_user') and ctx.get('action_user').name or ''"/></strong>.</p>

                                                <p>You may now proceed with the next steps as per the company’s pricing and sales procedures.</p>

                                                <p>If you have any further questions or need assistance, please feel free to reach out.</p>

                                                <p>Thank you for your contribution and attention to detail.</p>
                                                <p>
                                                    Regards,
                                                        <p>
                                                            <span t-out="object.company_id.name"/>
